  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><h4 data-start=\"332\" data-end=\"364\" id=\"isPasted\">• <strong data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"361\">Brand Introduction</strong>:</h4><p data-start=\"365\" data-end=\"633\">The Pet Me Store provides accessories and toys for dogs, delivering a themed package of unique toys, treats, and chews directly to customers' doors. Designed by dog lovers and tailored by size and chewing style, The Pet Me store will become one of the most beloved pet brands in the U.S and the world.</p><h4 data-start=\"635\" data-end=\"668\">• <strong data-start=\"642\" data-end=\"665\">Product Description</strong>:</h4><p data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"691\"><br></p><p data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"980\">For power chewers, BarkBox also offers <strong data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"893\">Super Chewer</strong> — a tougher version of the subscription box with long-lasting toys and tougher treats.</p><h4 data-start=\"982\" data-end=\"1020\">• <strong data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1019\">USP (Unique Selling Point)</strong>:</h4><ul data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1300\"><li data-start=\"1021\" data-end=\"1081\"><p data-start=\"1023\" data-end=\"1081\">Unique monthly themes (e.g., Star Wars, Camping, Holidays)</p></li><li data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1126\"><p data-start=\"1084\" data-end=\"1126\">Toys and treats made in the U.S. or Canada</p></li><li data-start=\"1127\" data-end=\"1190\"><p data-start=\"1129\" data-end=\"1190\">Options for allergies, dietary preferences, and tough chewers</p></li><li data-start=\"1191\" data-end=\"1247\"><p data-start=\"1193\" data-end=\"1247\">High retention and giftability = recurring commissions</p></li><li data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1300\"><p data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1300\">Excellent brand reputation and customer engagement</p></li></ul><h4 data-start=\"1302\" data-end=\"1327\">• <strong data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1326\">Payment Terms</strong>:</h4><ul data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1561\"><li data-start=\"1328\" data-end=\"1379\"><p data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1379\"><strong data-start=\"1330\" data-end=\"1344\">Commission</strong>: $10–$20 per new subscription sale</p></li><li data-start=\"1380\" data-end=\"1410\"><p data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1410\"><strong data-start=\"1382\" data-end=\"1401\">Cookie duration</strong>: 30 days</p></li><li data-start=\"1411\" data-end=\"1472\"><p data-start=\"1413\" data-end=\"1472\">Recurring commissions possible through upgrades or renewals</p></li><li data-start=\"1473\" data-end=\"1516\"><p data-start=\"1475\" data-end=\"1516\">Payout via Impact or ShareASale platforms</p></li><li data-start=\"1517\" data-end=\"1561\"><p data-start=\"1519\" data-end=\"1561\">Paid monthly with clear tracking dashboard</p></li></ul><h4 data-start=\"1563\" data-end=\"1592\">• <strong data-start=\"1570\" data-end=\"1591\">Other Information</strong>:</h4><ul data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1898\"><li data-start=\"1593\" data-end=\"1690\"><p data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1690\">Free to join via <a data-start=\"1612\" data-end=\"1645\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\" class=\"cursor-pointer\">Impact</a> or <a data-start=\"1649\" data-end=\"1690\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_new\" href=\"https://www.shareasale.com/\">ShareASale</a></p></li><li data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1725\"><p data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1725\">Dedicated affiliate support team</p></li><li data-start=\"1726\" data-end=\"1783\"><p data-start=\"1728\" data-end=\"1783\">Access to creative assets, banners, and seasonal promos</p></li><li data-start=\"1784\" data-end=\"1898\"><p data-start=\"1786\" data-end=\"1898\">Ideal for pet-focused influencers, bloggers, and Shopify store owners offering toy recommendations or gift boxes</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1900\" data-end=\"2012\"><br></p></div>",
